---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="About FinCalc Pro - Free Financial Calculators"
  description="Learn about FinCalc Pro, our mission to provide free, accurate financial calculators for mortgages, loans, investments, retirement, taxes, and more."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'About', url: '' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-prose mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About FinCalc Pro</h1>

    <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-6">
      FinCalc Pro is a free online resource dedicated to helping people make informed financial
      decisions through accurate, easy-to-use calculators. We believe that everyone deserves access
      to reliable financial tools — without hidden costs, sign-ups, or data collection.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Financial literacy starts with understanding the numbers. Whether you're shopping for a
      mortgage, planning for retirement, estimating your take-home pay, or deciding whether to rent
      or buy a home, our calculators give you clarity in seconds. Our mission is to remove the
      complexity from personal finance by providing transparent, formula-based tools that anyone can
      use.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">What We Offer</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">Our suite of <strong>31 free calculators</strong> covers six key areas of personal finance:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-1 text-muted-foreground">
      <li><strong>Loan Calculators</strong> — Mortgage, refinance, auto, personal, student, amortization, loan payoff, and debt-to-income.</li>
      <li><strong>Investment & Savings Calculators</strong> — Compound interest, CD, investment growth, dollar-cost averaging, and savings goals.</li>
      <li><strong>Retirement Calculators</strong> — 401(k), Roth IRA, Traditional IRA, retirement savings, and Social Security estimator.</li>
      <li><strong>Salary & Tax Calculators</strong> — Paycheck, salary, hourly-to-salary, and federal income tax.</li>
      <li><strong>General Finance Calculators</strong> — Net worth, inflation, ROI, break-even point, credit card payoff, and debt payoff.</li>
      <li><strong>Real Estate Calculators</strong> — Home affordability and rent vs. buy.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Your Privacy Matters</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      All calculations on FinCalc Pro run entirely in your browser. We never send your financial
      information to any server. There are no accounts, no sign-ups, and no data storage. What you
      calculate stays on your device.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Who We Are</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      We're a team of personal finance enthusiasts, software engineers, and data geeks who believe
      that good financial tools should be free and accessible to everyone. Our calculators use
      standard, publicly available financial formulas — the same ones used by banks, lenders, and
      financial planners — so you can trust the math behind your decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Get in Touch</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Have a suggestion, found a bug, or want to request a new calculator? We'd love to hear from
      you. Visit our <a href="/contact/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Contact page</a> to
      reach out.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
